<title>USA: Extended Stay raises $203 mln in placement.</title>
<headline>Extended Stay raises $203 mln in placement.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Extended Stay America Inc said it has raised $202.7 million from the sale of 11.5 million shares of its common stock at a price of $17.625 per share, bn a private placement.</p>
<p>It said proceeds from this sale will be used for general corporate purposes, including financing possible acquisitions and the construction of extended stay lodging facilities.</p>
</text>
